{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Do I truly seem that young?": "",
  "Yeah. But it sounds like I got it wrong. So my next guess is...": "",
  "...You never cease to amaze me, Yagami-san. You got it.": "",
  "So you're 27, huh? Wow, you're young.": "",
  "Not so much. That's almost 30.": "",
  "Mm. You went a little too high.": "",
  "Damn, I missed. Which means...": "",
  "...Do I seem like I'm in my thirties?": "",
  "Is there really that much of a difference between your twenties and your thirties...?": "",
  "That's not the issue.": "",
  "S-Sorry. In that case...": "",
  "Maybe you're older than me? Somewhere in your forties?": "",
  "May I head home now?": "",
  "Whoa whoa, I was just playing around!": "",
  "Get trampled by a stampede for all I care!": "",
  "Okay, I messed up! Seriously! I really am sorry!": "",
  "(That was a fail...)": "",
  "I don't know if I'm allowed to ask you, but...": "",
  "(I doubt I could just guess her measurements... Those clothes drape over her like a widow's shroud.)": "",
  "Might I ask where you're looking?": "",
  "Oh. Uh. Nowhere in particular!": "",
  "Umm...": "",
  "(Gah... I can't go any longer without knowing her figure. Curse this inquisitive detective mind of mine!)": "",
  "(...But is it really okay to ask her straight up?)": "",
  "I feel like your measurements would match those of a model.": "",
  "*chuckle* You're a curious little boy, aren't you... I can clearly see you're trying to guess my sizes.": "",
  "Sorry. It's a guy thing.": "",
  "Oh? Then what would be your estimation?": "",
  "Whoa. You're okay with me guessing?": "",
  "All right then...": "",
  "Let's see, those are... C cups? No, maybe even... D cups?": "",
  "...Your eyes scare me, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hehe.": "",
  "Hmm... I think... you'd be about...": "",
  "Would you mind not leering at me!?": "",
  "Well then. Now that that's over with...": "",
  "Actually, forget it. I feel like I'll lose my morals if I keep going.": "",
  "(...I don't know why I entertain these thoughts.)": "",
  "Hey, Amane-san...": "",
  "Hmm. It's not really going at all. The demands of my profession require all my time and energy.": "",
  "So are you saying you don't have a boyfriend?": "",
  "...Why do you ask?": "",
  "I'm asking 'cause if you did, he probably wouldn't want you hanging out alone with me.": "",
  "To be frank, this is what I do as a professional. Whether my boyfriend approves, or even exists to begin with, matters not.": "",
  "(So is she dating anyone... or did she just dodge my question?)": "",
  "I'll leave that up to your imagination.": "",
  "Don't be alarmed. I can often sense what people around me are thinking. I am a fortune teller, after all.": "",
  "(Then I'd better watch my thoughts.)": "",
  "\"Then I'd better watch out for dirty thoughts.\" That's what you just thought to yourself, isn't it?": "",
  "Hey now, I didn't go <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> far!": "",
  "It's fine... as long as they simply remain thoughts.": "",
  "Well then, don't mind if I do.": "",
  "Oh my. So you really are letting your mind wander... there.": "",
  "W-Wait! Please, refrain from this at once!": "",
  "Hahaha. I was just messing with you.": "",
  "Hmph. Fool.": "",
  "Hey now. Believe it or not, I'm actually quite the gentleman.": "",
  "...How can I be certain?": "",
  "So. Someone finally listened to your warning, huh?": "",
  "Yes. It would appear that tone and delivery is more crucial than I initially expected.": "",
  "Then does that mean your work issues are solved?": "",
  "It seems that would be the case.": "",
  "You know, Yagami-san... Ever since I met you, I feel like things have been going well for me.": "",
  "You see, I've always wanted to use my abilities to help other people.": "",
  "But no one would ever believe me. On the contrary, people would either get scared or make fun of me.": "",
  "It is said that a prophet is never accepted in their hometown. The same held true for me. Everyone was so cold...": "",
  "...It was.": "",
  "...Mm.": "",
  "You were the only one, Yagami-san.": "",
  "The only one to what?": "",
  "To hear what I've had to say from the beginning and even take action upon it.": "",
  "And you did it not only for my sake, but also for the sake of others.": "",
  "Well, of course. I want to use my abilities to help people too.": "",
  "Truly? You do?": "",
  "Yeah. Knowing there's something only you can do to make the world a better place is one of the best feelings in the world.": "",
  "I agree! That's how I feel when we're working together.": "",
  "Although, I do have to charge for compensation, since it is my job and all. A guy's gotta eat too.": "",
  "Ahaha. Well I doubt a glutton like you would starve.": "",
  "Regardless, my wish is to continue helping the people of Kamurocho.": "",
  "Aghhh... S-Starving...": "",
  "Oh, crap. That's...": "",
  "Welcome to the Beef Zone! Oh my...": "",
  "Hngh?": "",
  "Grah! At this rate, I could eat a whole cow! Scratch that—I could eat an entire herd of 'em!": "",
  "(Is he prioritizing his appetite over me? Or did he just not notice?)": "",
  "(Either way, I should just go about my business.)": "",
  "Hey, you! Gimme one of everything on the menu. Scratch that—gimme everything you got in the restaurant!": "",
  "I hate to ask, but would you mind settling your tab first?": "",
  "I don't wanna!": "",
  "C-Come again?": "",
  "I'm saying... that unless you bring me food right now... I'm gonna wreck the shit outta this place, starting with you!": "",
  "P-Please don't...!": "",
  "Feed me! Feed me!! FEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEED MEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE!!!": "",
  "(Shit! Is this what the cow calamity is?)": "",
  "(...Well, he does eat like a cow. Maybe I should intervene.)": "",
  "(Then again, I would be plunging headfirst into calamity...)": "",
  "(No. I can't just leave Kim-san hanging!)": "",
  "You better pay your bill if you plan on eating here.": "",
  "...Oh, I've seen you before.": "",
  "You're... Kasai's friend, aren't you?": "",
  "Wrong. Definitely wrong. ": "",
  "Now listen close. If you don't pay, you can't eat. And if you wanna eat, you gotta pay. Get that through your thick head.": "",
  "You getting in the way of my grub session? If so, I'm gonna hafta let loose on you! Kasai's friend or not!": "",
  "Then step outside.": "",
  "My friend works hard to run this business. And if you can't respect that, then I can't let you leave.": "",
  "...What a bunch of baloney.": "",
  "Fine then. I could use a little appetizer before the main course arrives!": "",
  "I'LL GNASH YA TO PIECES!!!": "",
  "You know you'll get punished by the food god, right?": "",
  "...There's a food god?": "",
  "Oh yes. The food god's job is to bless whoever pays for their food and curse those who don't.": "",
  "As the proverb goes: \"He who does not work, neither shall he eat.\" Do you really want to lose your ability to eat forever!?": "",
  "Y-You're lying! There's no such thing!": "",
  "It is exactly as he says.": "",
  "I am a divine soothsayer. My predictions are absolute.": "",
  "A divine soothsayer!? That don't sound good...": "",
  "Wh-Why're you lookin' at me like that?": "",
  "As I thought. I see the sign of the hunger calamity rising before you.": "",
  "What!? ...What's a hunger calamity?": "",
  "You have enraged the deity that presides over all edible food. At this rate, you will succumb to hunger... and die.": "",
  "No! Say it ain't so!": "",
  "And then... as punishment for your gluttony, you shall descend into the lowest circle of hell!": "",
  "A-Aiyeeeeeeeeeeeee!!!": "",
  "Now, make your decision! Pay your bill and atone for your sins, or descend into the netherworld!": "",
  "It looks like...": "",
  "I bit off... more than I could chew...": "",
  "Thank you for your business!": "",
  "Yagami-san. Fortune-teller lady. Thank you for driving away that thief.": "",
  "You two are incredible.": "",
  "Nah, we were just doing our thing.": "",
  "But... does this mean my cow calamity is gone?": "",
  "I mean, Sakakiba is more of a cow than most actual cows, so...": "",
  "Your calamity still remains.": "",
  "The sign of the cow calamity hasn't disappeared. If anything...": "",
  "It's gotten bigger.": "",
  "...What could this possibly mean?": "",
  "...It would seem that the cow calamity continues to elude us.": "",
  "I guess we just gotta be patient.": "",
  "Nevertheless... You never cease to amaze me.": "",
  "I can't believe you decided to help your friend despite the calamity at hand.": "",
  "I guess I'm the same as you, Amane-san.": "",
  "I had the power to fix the situation, so I did whatever I could. Simple as that.": "",
  "...You truly are a splendid individual.": "",
  "Right back at you.": "",
  "...Yagami-san. There is something I must ask.": "",
  "...Well...": "",
  "Would you still consider going out with me, even after your calamity is repelled?": "",
  "Whenever we're together, I find myself having a wonderful time.": "",
  "And... I also feel more positive. About who I am.": "",
  "...Okay then. Sure. We can go out anytime.": "",
  "*chuckle* Would you also consider working as my full-time partner from now on?": "",
  "Let's... save that discussion for another time.": "",
  "Today was quite enjoyable, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yeah. It was a solid date.": "",
  "*chuckle* If only the calamity hadn't bothered us...": "",
  "I suppose I should say farewell for now.": "",
  "That's it for today.": "",
  "...Don't you feel drained? Watching out for the cow this whole time has left me... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>udder</font_kind>-ly exhausted.": "",
  "(Was she on edge during the entire date? If that's the case, then I screwed up...)": "",
  "Please remain vigilant, Yagami-san. Farewell...": "",
  "Whoa. Nice dress.": "",
  "Thank you. One of my customers bought this for me back when I was a hostess.": "",
  "Whoa! You were a hostess, too...?": "",
  "Yes. I figured it was an ideal position for observing customer interactions.": "",
  "However, I ended up getting fired after accusing a client of theft.": "",
  "Wow. You really have been through a lot.": "",
  "Aside from all that...": "",
  "I made sure to dress appropriately for our date.": "",
  "(This is more like an escort than a date.)": "",
  "Not at all. It's common to see hostesses escorting people in Kamurocho.": "",
  "That's not the point...": "",
  "I think... You're beautiful.": "",
  "*chuckle* Flattery will get you nowhere.": "",
  "Hey, I was just being honest.": "",
  "Then thank you.": "",
  "I took a chance by putting this on, but the look on your face tells me it paid off.": "",
  "All right, where should we go today?": "",
  "Then how about trying your luck? Who knows, you might have a talent for it.": "",
  "Perhaps that may be the case.": "",
  "How about we sit down somewhere and chat for a while?": "",
  "Yes, good idea.": "",
  "Yagami-san, it's almost time for my appointment.": "",
  "Oh, right. Your patron awaits, huh?": "",
  "Then let's head out.": "",
  "This cow sure is taking its sweet time, isn't it? Wonder what's keeping it.": "",
  "Uh. Amane-san?": "",
  "Yagami-san... I'm not sure how to convey this to you... But as soon as you looked at me, I noticed it got bigger. As if it were engorged.": "",
  "Could you be talking about...": "",
  "...My calamity sign?": "",
  "Indeed. It swells with a curious negative energy, the likes of which I've never seen before.": "",
  "There must be some mistake. I haven't gotten any bigger at all.": "",
  "You? What I speak of is your calamity sign. It shudders and throbs with an aggressive negative energy...": "",
  "...Oh. That's what you meant.": "",
  "...What else would I mean?": "",
  "Nothing. Forget it.": "",
  "Now that you mention it, something does feel kinda off...": "",
  "Indeed. Your misfortune seems to be amassing... waiting for the fated moment.": "",
  "Well, Yagami-san? Did you have a good time today?": "",
  "Yeah. I actually forgot about my cow problems for maybe a minute or two.": "",
  "Wonderful. Still, don't let your guard down.": "",
  "Anyway, let's stay in touch, yes?": "",
  "Good. Attempting to foresee your calamity has left me quite drained.": "",
  "(Was she anxious the entire time? If so, then I haven't been doing my job...)": "",
  "Farewell...": "",
  "Yo, Tsumugi-san! Ready to get this show on the road?": "",
  "Ah, yes. Thank you for coming all this way... I'll speak with you later, Yagami-san.": "",
  "All right. See you.": "",
  "Wait a second...": "",
  "You datin' this guy, Tsumugi-san?": "",
  "Oh... No... He is a merely an acquaintance.": "",
  "Huh. Wouldn't have figured that, seein' the way you two are lookin' at each other.": "",
  "Come now. Yagami-san is more like...": "",
  "...A friend.": "",
  "Right...?": "",
  "(Amane-san... Are you really going along with this criminal?)": "",
  "Sorry to keep you waiting, Yagami-san.": "",
  "It's fine... Let's get going, huh?": "",
  "What's going on with you, Amane-san?": "",
  "The sign of the cow calamity...": "",
  "...Has vanished.": "",
  "It has?": "",
  "Like, completely?": "",
  "Huh. Guess that means we're done watching out for cows.": "",
  "This is troubling indeed.": "",
  "What's wrong now?": "",
  "...O-Oh, that was merely a slip of the tongue.": "",
  "Okay... So what are your plans now that the calamity's over and done with?": "",
  "...Well, I'm certainly not ready to go home, if that's what you're asking.": "",
  "Yes! Let's do that!": "",
  "How about we kill some time for a bit? Ever played darts before?": "",
  "How about we take a rest somewhere?": "",
  "We should.": "",
  "So. My calamity's really gone?": "",
  "Yes. I see no trace of it whatsoever.": "",
  "(She seems kinda down for some reason...)": "",
  "Amane-san. If my calamity sign is gone, does that mean I'm in the clear?": "",
  "Ah. Well. About that...": "",
  "I believe you shouldn't let your guard down just yet.": "",
  "Because...": "",
  "Well, you never know when your calamity might return! Vigilance is of the utmost importance!": "",
  "(What is she talking about?)": "",
  "(I should probably dig deeper into this.)": "",
  "Amane-san, would you mind clarifying something? I thought my calamity was gone for good.": "",
  "...No. It is merely beyond my comprehension at the moment.": "",
  "You mean you can't tell?": "",
  "Mm. It is as I feared. Not only did your sign of calamity vanish...": "",
  "...But everyone else's has, too. Their signs have all disappeared.": "",
  "Earlier, I took a look at the patriarch and the rest of his group, yet witnessed nothing out of the ordinary.": "",
  "But not long afterward...": "",
  "I received word that one of his subordinates was stabbed by an enemy.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Umm...": "เอ่อ...",
  "Hehe.": "เฮะเฮะ",
  "That's it for today.": "วันนี้พอแค่นี้ค่ะ",
  "Farewell...": "ลาก่อน...",
  "Wait a second...": "เดี๋ยวก่อนนะ...",
  "Because...": "ก็เพราะว่า..."
 }
}
